    "startS": 26.2,
    "endS": 28.5,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "So my book is called Playful Pottery.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-07T21:55:19.006Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "85d820b1-52f6-488b-a910-d1f4470b818d",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 30,
    "endS": 37.6,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I wanted something that was a more simplified book about pottery for beginners.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-07T21:55:19.006Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "9d96f843-51b8-4eef-abc5-d007494a5f36",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 107.6,
    "endS": 119.7,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that was like the main theme was creativity involves, um, being kind to yourself, which I don't think is Talked about as much as it should be.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-07T21:55:19.006Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "d3a8bfc2-a8b5-4e9d-8ccc-707d7fd8cab4",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 119.8,
    "endS": 130.5,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that there's a pressure to produce things. As a creative person, but not to be kind of kind to yourself about what the process is going to be like,",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-07T21:55:19.006Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "1bf514da-c20a-494a-b0b8-2bc526d61fe1",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 133.5,
    "endS": 147.2,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "When you're kind to yourself, you are rolling with the punches. You are more open to be flexible with your designs, and you can end up with something that turns out way better than your original design.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-07T21:55:19.006Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "1cb6f432-771e-46d2-86d6-10735ba9a6e0",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 501.6,
    "endS": 521.3,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "And then you're like, well, what if this looked slightly different? Or what if this, instead of a tulip was a daffodil? And let's try to achieve that. So it's kind of like sitting at the wheel and just like letting yourself adjust, grow whatever ideas and just see if they're achievable.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-10-07T21:55:19.006Z"
  },
